### Controls and comparisons

Treatments (same shapes/seed/hardware):
- T0 (control/baseline 1): 1F1B, no interleaving (`--num-layers-per-virtual-pipeline-stage` absent = 1 chunk). This is the classical baseline with bubble ~(PP-1)/(PP+m-1).
- T1 (baseline 2): 1F1B interleaved, v=2 virtual stages (`--num-layers-per-virtual-pipeline-stage 2`): reduced bubble.
- T2 (baseline 3): ZB-1P (`--zero-bubble-max-pending-backward 0`), manual schedule, with interleaving.
- T3 (target): ZB-2P (`--zero-bubble-max-pending-backward 2*PP`).
